      ],
      "title": "#2 无奈"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3106001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "樱她……真的是被天启抓走的吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "很有可能。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "FULI仓库失窃事件已经引起了人类警方的注意，但他们至今未能锁定目标嫌疑人，我怀疑这件事极有可能不是人类所为。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "加上我和优纪不久前曾多次遭遇天启对FULI手办的破坏事件。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "因此我很确定这次FULI仓库失窃事件是天启所为。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "那……樱她会不会遇到危险？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "如果真的是被天启抓走，后果将不容乐观。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106008",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "什么？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "所以我们必须尽快找到樱的下落，这是确保她安全的唯一办法。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "那还等什么，现在，立刻，马上出发去找樱！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "同意，我们没有时间可以浪费，现在就动身吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "等等！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "你又怎么啦？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你们，不会是要我和这两个笨蛋姐妹一起合作吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "不不不不，我可不要！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "想到要跟这两个笨蛋朝夕相处，我就全身上下都觉得难受。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "所以，我拒绝！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你真的太任性了，莉可……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106019",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我不管，我就是不要！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3106021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "你到底想怎样啦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "这也不行，那也不行，我们可没时间陪你玩任性的游戏。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "樱她……要是真的被天启抓走的话，现在一定在哪个角落偷偷哭泣吧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "这样吧，我们来打个赌怎么样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "打赌……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "我可没那个工夫，你想怎么样就怎么样吧，我们不奉陪了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "姐姐……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "等等，尤娜！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "不会浪费很多时间的，我们速战速决。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "你想怎么赌？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "嗯哼，我早就已经准备好了，你们看那边——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "这是什么东西，奇奇怪怪的方块，每一面都标着不同的数字。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这是……骰子？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "嘿嘿，想不到吧！很好玩的哟！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "好玩……么……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "什么呀什么呀，快让我看看！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "喏，就是这个，让人类欲罢不能的一种游戏。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你要不要挑战一下？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "要要要！这个怎么玩，快告诉我！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "姐姐你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "规则很简单，我们两个随便拿一个骰子，谁摇出的数字大，谁就赢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3107024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "哈哈哈哈哈我先来，玩游戏我还从没有失过手，你输定了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-133",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3106001,
