      "title": "#3 打个赌吧！"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3108001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "准备好了吗，尤娜，莉可？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "准、准备好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "嗯哼，我早就准备好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那么我们就开始了哦——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "3。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "2。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "1——开始！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "莉可与宫本尤娜同时掷出地上的两颗骰子，结果令大家深感意外。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "这……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "嘻，是我赢了哟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "我居然输了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "这不可能，不可能，不可能！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "姐姐怎么可能会输呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "哼，你的姐姐以前没有输过，是因为没有遇到我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "我不信，这个世界上还没有我赢不了的游戏！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "切，你的世界才有多大。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "真的……是我输了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "没错，你输了，我赢了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "所以，我会跟优纪、和江一起去天启的大本营找樱的下落。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "而你们两个，再见了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "姐姐，你还好吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "不好！非常不好！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "这个结果我不喜欢，我们再来一次！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "咦，骰子呢？刚刚还在这里的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "愿、愿赌服输，我们说好了的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "那两颗骰子在这里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "咦，莉可的这颗骰子，好像有点不对……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "这个骰子只有两个面的数字有所不同，其他四面的数字都是6。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3108031",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "你，你果然对骰子做了手脚！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-134",
