      ],
      "title": "#4 豪赌的莉可"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3109001",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "卑鄙的家伙，居然使诈！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "那、那又怎么样，反正是我赢了，只要能赢，用什么办法都无所谓吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和、和江，我们……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "虽然莉可的做法不太可取，但她说的没错。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我们事先并没有要求莉可和尤娜不能使用其他的办法。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "也就是说，我们只能以结果来定输赢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "所以说，谁叫你那么笨呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "你！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "让我承认这个结果，实在是有点……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可是，我们没有时间了，樱她……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "好吧，这个结果，我姑且可以接受。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109014",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "但是，你惹怒了我，你会后悔的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "姐、姐姐，不要生气……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "你不是喜欢打赌么，我们就再打一个赌怎么样！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你想搞什么花样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "我们就比赛谁可以先找到樱，你敢么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "这……哈哈哈哈哈，你果然是大笨蛋，哈哈哈哈哈！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "我一定会比你先找到樱，我发誓！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "小惠，我们走！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "啊、好，好的，姐姐……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "她们走得好快，转眼就不见了呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "切，神气什么呀，是担心大家不知道她是个热血大笨蛋吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "看我干什么，我脸上有什么东西吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我只是觉得，你是不是真的很担心她会比你早点找到樱呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "乱、乱讲，我什么时候怕过，我们也赶快出发吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "看来我们很有可能会在天启的大本营再遇到那对姐妹。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109030",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我，莉可一定会比她们先找到樱的下落。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109031",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "而她们两个笨蛋姐妹，会再一次输得彻彻底底。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我们走吧，和江，莉可~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3109033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "嗯，走。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-135",
