      "title": "#5 不甘心的她"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3110001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "咦，出现了！是分岔路！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你这家伙真是很难懂诶，这有什么好兴奋的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江和江，你记得这里的，对吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……是。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哎嘿嘿，上次我们离开废弃工厂回家的时候，路过了这里呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "当然虽然发生了一些小插曲，但是好庆幸我们最后还是平安地到家了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你还好意思提起那次。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "如果不是你非要去帮那个迷路哭泣的小孩找到她的父母。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我们就不会在路上耽误那么长的时间。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "主人也不会因为规定时间内等不到我们而心急如焚。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是是是，和江说得都对。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "只是，那个孩子真的好可怜呢，优纪不忍心嘛……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你、你不要这么看着我啦，和江……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "下次再遇到这种事情，我一定……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你还是省省吧，我知道你还是会做一样的选择。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嘿嘿，但是你会陪着我的，对吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……会的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哈哈哈哈，好开心！有和江在，无论去哪里都能让我感到安心~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "果然果然，在这个世界上，除了主人以外，优纪最最喜欢和江啦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "咦，莉可，你怎么不跟上呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3110022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "唔，这就来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
