      "title": "#6 魔王的假面"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3111001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "这座仓库已经被搬运干净了么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "掌机",
          "text": "是的，狩猎者大人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "掌机",
          "text": "到处都检查过，这座仓库全部手办都被咱们运走了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "做的不错，回去会好好赏你们的，呵呵呵~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仙人掌",
          "text": "谢谢狩猎者大人！谢谢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薯条",
          "text": "（谢什么谢，你这个蠢货……）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仙人掌",
          "text": "（啊，老大给赏赐，不说谢谢，那要说什么……？）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薯条",
          "text": "（我真是对你的愚蠢感到窒息……）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仙人掌",
          "text": "（…………）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薯条",
          "text": "（嘿呀，你不知道，那个狩猎者大人说的赏赐，其实是、其实是……）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仙人掌",
          "text": "（是什么……？）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薯条",
          "text": "（是要把你……）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "你们两个小可爱，在偷偷说些什么呢，让我也加入好吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薯条",
          "text": "对、对不起，狩狩狩猎者大人……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "哎呀，真是的，对不起这三个字，不可以随意对女士讲出来哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薯条",
          "text": "知、知道了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仙人掌",
          "text": "是，狩猎者大人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "你们两个，任务结束的时候记得留下来，我会给你们……特别的关照哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仙人掌",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薯条",
          "text": "……糟了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "好了，都下去吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "你驯服手下的方式，还真是奇特。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "呵呵，这样有什么不对的呢，乖巧顺从的仆人，需要一个善于调教的主子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "您比谁都清楚这一点，不是吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "我交给你的事情，现在怎么样了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "呵呵，您交给我的那些事情，自然不敢怠慢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "我已经派手下四处搜查清楚了，您要的涂料配方和特别的涂装技术，已经全都拿到了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "很好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "这些FULI仓库中的手办，你是怎么处理的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "已经按照您的指示，运往了我们的总部所在。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "运往了总部？我可不记得告诉过你运去的地点。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "呵呵，虽然您没有说明，但您一定是这么想的，对不对呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "好极了，你果然是我最得力的助手。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "有时候我不得不感到危险。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "我不明白您的意思。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "你记住，太过聪明有时候并不是一件好事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3111038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "是，大人，我记住了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
